  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>On solving above equation we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>I</mi></math></p>",
